{"seq":1,"slug":"valuation-methods","title":"房地产估值三大方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/real-estate-investing/analysis/valuation-methods","wordCount":1603,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"房地产估值三大方法\">房地产估值三大方法</h1><p>给一栋商业写字楼定价 3 亿元而不是 2.5 亿元，这个判断背后需要可验证的逻辑链条。房地产估值不像股票有连续竞价市场给出即时价格——每次交易都是对唯一资产的独立定价行为。三种经典估值方法各自从不同角度逼近「合理价格」，它们在实践中互相校验而非互相替代。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三种方法的逻辑起点\">核心概念：三种方法的逻辑起点</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[房地产估值] --&gt; B[收益法 Income Approach]&#10;    A --&gt; C[比较法 Sales Comparison]&#10;    A --&gt; D[成本法 Cost Approach]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;核心问题:未来现金流值多少？&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[&quot;适用:收益型物业&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;核心问题:类似物业卖了多少？&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[&quot;适用:交易活跃的市场&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;核心问题:重建这个物业要花多少？&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[&quot;适用:特殊用途/新建物业&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[房地产估值] --&gt; B[收益法 Income Approach]\n    A --&gt; C[比较法 Sales Comparison]\n    A --&gt; D[成本法 Cost Approach]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"核心问题:未来现金流值多少？\"]\n    B --&gt; B2[\"适用:收益型物业\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"核心问题:类似物业卖了多少？\"]\n    C --&gt; C2[\"适用:交易活跃的市场\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"核心问题:重建这个物业要花多少？\"]\n    D --&gt; D2[\"适用:特殊用途/新建物业\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>逻辑基础</th>\n<th>核心输入</th>\n<th>最佳适用场景</th>\n<th>主要局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>收益法</td>\n<td>资产价值 = 未来现金流折现</td>\n<td>NOI、Cap Rate/折现率</td>\n<td>出租物业，有稳定租约</td>\n<td>依赖假设，对折现率敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>比较法</td>\n<td>价格由市场共识决定</td>\n<td>可比交易案例</td>\n<td>交易活跃的标准化物业</td>\n<td>没有完全相同的物业</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本法</td>\n<td>价值 = 地价 + 重建成本 - 折旧</td>\n<td>建造成本、土地价值</td>\n<td>新建物业、特殊用途</td>\n<td>无法反映市场供需</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"收益法-income-approach\">收益法（Income Approach）</h2><p>收益法是机构投资者和银行最依赖的估值方法，因为它直接回答了投资的核心问题：「这笔现金流值多少钱？」</p>\n<h3 id=\"直接资本化法-direct-capitalization\">直接资本化法（Direct Capitalization）</h3><p>最简形式——将单年 NOI 除以市场 Cap Rate 得到价值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>R</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Value = \\frac{NOI}{Cap\\ Rate}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>适用条件：租金稳定、无重大资本支出、物业处于成熟运营状态。例如，一栋满租的社区购物中心，NOI 为 500 万元/年，同区域同品质物业的市场 Cap Rate 为 5.5%：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>500</mn><mtext>万</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>5.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>9091</mn><mtext>万</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mn>9100</mn><mtext>万</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Value = \\frac{500万}{5.5\\%} = 9091万 \\approx 9100万</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1019em;vertical-align:-0.7416em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5.5%</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">万</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7416em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9091</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">万</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9100</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">万</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"折现现金流法-dcf\">折现现金流法（DCF）</h3><p>当现金流不稳定（空置、租约到期、翻新期间）或投资者有特定持有期计划时，DCF 是更精确的工具：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>O</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>V</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>T</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Value = \\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\frac{NOI_t - CapEx_t}{(1+r)^t} + \\frac{Terminal\\ Value}{(1+r)^T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0954em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7196em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">pE</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3074em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7673em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mina</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中终值通常用退出 Cap Rate 估算：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>V</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>O</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>R</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Terminal\\ Value = \\frac{NOI_{T+1}}{Exit\\ Cap\\ Rate}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mina</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4114em;vertical-align:-0.4811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9303em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.452em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3567em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2028em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>DCF 的关键假设包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>租金增长率（通常 2-4%/年）</li>\n<li>空置率变动路径</li>\n<li>资本支出时点和金额</li>\n<li>折现率（WACC 或目标 IRR）</li>\n<li>退出 Cap Rate（通常比入口 Cap Rate 高 25-50bp 以反映物业老化）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"收益法的敏感性\">收益法的敏感性</h3><p>房地产 DCF 对折现率和退出 Cap Rate 极其敏感。每 25bp 的 Cap Rate 变动对价值的影响约 4-5%：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>退出 Cap Rate</th>\n<th>估值（假设 NOI $600万）</th>\n<th>变动幅度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>5.0%</td>\n<td>$1.20 亿</td>\n<td>+9.1%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5.25%</td>\n<td>$1.14 亿</td>\n<td>+3.6%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5.5%</td>\n<td>$1.10 亿</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5.75%</td>\n<td>$1.04 亿</td>\n<td>-5.2%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6.0%</td>\n<td>$1.00 亿</td>\n<td>-9.1%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"比较法-sales-comparison-approach\">比较法（Sales Comparison Approach）</h2><p>比较法的逻辑朴素而有力：一个物业的价值由市场中类似物业的实际成交价格决定。这是住宅市场和流动性较好的商业市场的主流方法。</p>\n<h3 id=\"操作步骤\">操作步骤</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>选取可比案例</strong>：同区域、同品质、近期成交（通常 6-12 个月内）、物理特征相似</li>\n<li><strong>标准化调整</strong>：按单位面积价格（$/sqm）进行比较，对差异项做加减调整</li>\n<li><strong>综合判断</strong>：取调整后价格的中位数或加权平均</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"调整因子示例\">调整因子示例</h3><p>对住宅物业，典型调整项包括：面积差异、楼层/朝向、装修标准、车位配比、成交时间（时间调整反映市场涨跌）。对商业物业则增加：租户质量、租约剩余期限、物业状况、物业管理品牌等维度。</p>\n<p>比较法的核心挑战在于<strong>没有完全相同的物业</strong>。两栋看似类似的写字楼，可能因为一楼的租户是跨国公司（信用 AAA）vs. 初创企业（信用 BB），租约价值差异达 20%+。这就是为什么商业物业的比较法最终仍需要收益法作为交叉验证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本法-cost-approach\">成本法（Cost Approach）</h2><p>成本法从供给侧出发：如果重建这个物业需要花多少钱，那么现存物业的价值不应显著偏离重建成本（减去折旧）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>V</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Value = Land\\ Value + Replacement\\ Cost - Depreciation</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ce</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">os</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ia</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中折旧包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>物理折旧</strong>：结构和设备的磨损老化</li>\n<li><strong>功能折旧</strong>：设计过时（如无电梯的 5 层办公楼）</li>\n<li><strong>经济折旧</strong>：外部环境恶化（如周边规划变化）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>成本法在以下场景最有价值：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>新建物业（折旧 ≈ 0，验证开发利润是否合理）</li>\n<li>特殊用途物业（教堂、政府办公楼——无可比交易）</li>\n<li>保险估值（重建成本是赔付基准）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>其局限在于无法反映市场供需：一个供过于求的市场中，物业可能远低于重建成本交易。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三法交叉验证\">三法交叉验证</h2><p>成熟的估值实践从不依赖单一方法。三法结果的<strong>收敛程度</strong>本身就是重要信号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>三法收敛（差异 &lt; 10%）：市场定价合理，投资者可有信心</li>\n<li>收益法 &gt; 比较法：可能高估了未来增长假设，或市场整体悲观</li>\n<li>比较法 &gt; 成本法：市场溢价高于重建成本，新开发有利可图</li>\n<li>成本法 &gt; 比较法：市场低迷，存量物业折价交易</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"ai-驱动的估值革新\">AI 驱动的估值革新</h2><p>2026 年，AI 正在改变估值实践的效率和精度：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>自动估值模型（AVM）</strong>：利用机器学习处理海量交易数据，为住宅提供即时估值</li>\n<li><strong>多模态分析</strong>：结合卫星图像、街景数据、人口流动模式预测区域增值潜力</li>\n<li><strong>情景模拟</strong>：AI 可在分钟级完成传统分析师需要数天的 DCF 敏感性分析</li>\n</ul>\n<p>但 AI 估值的适用边界清晰：标准化程度高的住宅市场效果好；异质性强的商业物业仍高度依赖人工判断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>收益法是投资决策的首选工具，但对假设极其敏感——永远做敏感性分析</li>\n<li>比较法提供市场共识锚点，但需要足够的可比样本和合理的调整逻辑</li>\n<li>成本法设定了价值的理论上限（无人会付超过重建成本加合理利润的价格）</li>\n<li>三法交叉验证的收敛/偏离本身是重要的决策信号</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../foundations/return-metrics\">房地产投资回报指标体系</a>——估值方法中的 Cap Rate 和 IRR 如何与投资回报指标衔接</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../corporate-finance/valuation-methods/discounted-cash-flow\">折现现金流估值</a>——DCF 方法论在企业估值中的通用框架</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"房地产估值三大方法","id":"房地产估值三大方法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三种方法的逻辑起点","id":"核心概念-三种方法的逻辑起点"},{"level":2,"text":"收益法（Income Approach）","id":"收益法-income-approach"},{"level":3,"text":"直接资本化法（Direct Capitalization）","id":"直接资本化法-direct-capitalization"},{"level":3,"text":"折现现金流法（DCF）","id":"折现现金流法-dcf"},{"level":3,"text":"收益法的敏感性","id":"收益法的敏感性"},{"level":2,"text":"比较法（Sales Comparison Approach）","id":"比较法-sales-comparison-approach"},{"level":3,"text":"操作步骤","id":"操作步骤"},{"level":3,"text":"调整因子示例","id":"调整因子示例"},{"level":2,"text":"成本法（Cost Approach）","id":"成本法-cost-approach"},{"level":2,"text":"三法交叉验证","id":"三法交叉验证"},{"level":2,"text":"AI 驱动的估值革新","id":"ai-驱动的估值革新"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"房地产投资回报指标体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/real-estate-investing/foundations/return-metrics"},"next":{"title":"房地产市场周期与宏观分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/real-estate-investing/analysis/market-cycles"}}